# CR 612.2, 708.8, 702.37e; Putrid Raptor's ruling: a text-changing effect that changes creature types may be used on it while
# it is face down, and it changes the kind of card its morph cost discards. Artificial Evolution turns the face-down Raptor's
# Zombie into Goblin: turning it up then refuses Walking Corpse (a Zombie) and discards Raging Goblin, and the Raptor is a Goblin
# Dinosaur Beast once face up (the effect still applies, CR 708.8).

